{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleaning the Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning the Space is a game where you clean up space debris using various tools based on <strong><i><u>physics interactions</u></i></strong> in <strong><i><u>zero gravity</u></i></strong>. Refuel your oxygen and fuel, avoid obstacles, and clean the universe while solving the <strong>Kessler syndrome</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Priced like a snack, but you\u2019ll be cleaning orbit debris instead of crumbs \u2014 all in zero gravity with physics-based chaos.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tools</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Grab the laser gun and swing it around to clear debris. There are two types, each with different power levels and\u00a0ranges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/2edff726a80c1e4e53ba7ec6277c731d.poster.avif?t=1761662443\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/2edff726a80c1e4e53ba7ec6277c731d.webm?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/2edff726a80c1e4e53ba7ec6277c731d.mp4?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thruster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Use your thrusters to send large debris flying away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/be5a8f66dcbf8b43896486aa1c136f58.poster.avif?t=1761662443\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/be5a8f66dcbf8b43896486aa1c136f58.webm?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/be5a8f66dcbf8b43896486aa1c136f58.mp4?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket, Bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use rockets to clear distant or dangerous debris.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/9f77d72f1c7e22c295dd511b9d045d7d.poster.avif?t=1761662443\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/9f77d72f1c7e22c295dd511b9d045d7d.webm?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/9f77d72f1c7e22c295dd511b9d045d7d.mp4?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use the cannon to blast away debris all at once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/b3104d12f289f443f589c72cddef0bfa.poster.avif?t=1761662443\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120400/extras/b3104d12f289f443f589c72cddef0bfa.webm?t=1761662443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com